hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1595","I am Issa bin Ibrahim Al-Ghafiqi, Ibn Wahb told us, on the authority of Yahya bin Humayd, on the authority of Qurra bin Abdul Rahman, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, He said: Abu Salama bin Abdul Rahman told me, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Whoever performs a rak’ah of Prayer, he completed it before the Imam raised his cross.”"
